    {"op": "note", "text": "Starts after Ring-a-Ding-Ding (VMQTops) with Benny killed in the casino and the Platinum Chip carried, so no Benny at the Fort (VStoryEventBennyKilledCasino 1). Medicine 80 is given so Caesar can be operated on by hand in Et Tumor, Brute?. The Strip, Cottonwood Cove, the vault, the Lucky 38, Nellis, the Ultra-Luxe, Hidden Valley and Hoover Dam are reached with move_player (travel stand-ins). Message boxes hold the game (given menu 1001 closed): each box is closed as the player's OK would. Path: Legion; House killed at his life support; Boomer, White Glove Society and Brotherhood leaders killed or blown up; Caesar cured by surgery; Kimball killed at the dam."},
